# Bountiful Landscape's {T} in "{T}, Sacrifice this land: Search ..." (CR 602.2b, 118.3): once the land is tapped for {C} it cannot
# be sacrificed to search, even though sacrificing needs no other mana.

[Bot1 Deck]
Bountiful Landscape
Forest x8
Island x8
Mountain x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Bountiful Landscape.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Bountiful Landscape.Activate(Ability: {T}: Add {C})
! Bot1.Battlefield.Bountiful Landscape.Activate(Ability: {T}, Sacrifice this land)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Bountiful Landscape.Tapped = true
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
